{
  "title": "Java unit tests outside Mage.Server never run in CI or make check",
  "description": "The test-java target added for issue \
firecallback-50ms-silent-drop only runs `mvn -q test -pl Mage.Server`. Every \
other module's JUnit tests have no runner anywhere: lint-java and the CI java \
job use -DskipTests, and the only other mvn test invocation is verify-decks \
(Mage.Verify, single test class). Never-executed test classes by module: Mage \
(18), Mage.Client (8), Mage.Client.Bridge (6, including \
BridgeCallbackHandlerTest and BridgeClientTest — core harness code), \
Mage.Client.Observer (5), Mage.Common (3), Mage.Server.Console (1). Direction: \
expand test-java module by module (some suites may have bit-rotted since they \
never ran; fix or delete failures as they surface), e.g. `mvn -q test -pl \
'!Mage.Tests,!Mage.Verify'` once everything passes. Mage.Tests stays excluded \
(the huge card-test suite) and Mage.Verify is covered by verify-decks. Also \
align the quiet_check trigger for test-java with whatever module set is \
chosen.",
